  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rdjupad revision av bidragspartner</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indepth audits of grant partners</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden har tecknat avtal med ett antal partners. Dessa f&#xf6;rdjupade revisioner kommer att utf&#xf6;ras p&#xe5; vissa utvalda partners med en av v&#xe5;ra ramverks revisorer som en extra kontroll f&#xf6;r att hj&#xe4;lpa till att f&#xf6;rebygga och uppt&#xe4;cka korruption samt komma med olika s&#xe4;tt att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra den ekonomiska f&#xf6;rvaltningen av v&#xe5;ra bidrag</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This will cover indepth audits of selected partners.  The Embassy wishes to engage framework auditors to carry out independent audits in addition to annual audits conducted by our agreement partners. This is seen as a way to ensure that our partner&apos;s auditors are conducting audits as stipulated in the agreement and also as a way of preventing/ detecting corruption</narrative>
  </description>
